      id: `Pluto dalam Astrologi: Transformation, power, death/rebirth, intensity. Pluto governs transformation, power, regeneration, and the subconscious. Ruling Scorpio, it brings destruction that clea. Temukan zodiak Pluto Anda gratis di lunaxstar.com/natal.`,
